# Ship the upgrade release manifest AND its JSON Schema as package data in the
# SDIST (D049).
#
# The wheel already gets them via [tool.setuptools.package-data] in
# pyproject.toml (dontpanic_orchestrate = ["data/*.json"]). The sdist, however,
# is built from the file manifest, so the package-data JSON must be listed here
# explicitly or it would be omitted from the source distribution — and the D045
# package-relative loader would then fail to find releases.json when installed
# from an sdist. The glob also covers upgrade-releases.schema.json so the schema
# travels with the manifest. Path is relative to the project root (where
# pyproject.toml is); the package source tree lives under scripts/.
include scripts/dontpanic_orchestrate/data/*.json
